    "notes": [
      "Most Power conferences mandate formal availability reports primarily for conference games. Big Ten midweek/gameday reports for league opponents do not begin until mid-September 2026. SEC and Big 12 policies similarly emphasize conference competition. Consequently, early-season (non-conference) weeks rely heavily on coach comments and beat reporting, and many FBS programs publish little or no comprehensive public list. Absence from this document is not evidence that a roster is healthy.",
      "Absence from this report is NOT evidence that a roster is healthy — do not render 'no injuries' for a team the report does not cover.",
      "Statuses follow the publisher's own designations; none has been inferred.",
      "Only injuries and statuses explicitly reported by the cited sources are included. Speculative depth-chart chatter without a stated status is omitted."
    ],
